ail."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [428.5087890625, 211.4035186767578], "pos": [-1233.4901123046875, -275.4748840332031], "id": 123, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["```\n欢迎进入我的主页\nQQ交流1群：1058747239\nQQ交流2群：1072010342\n可定制工作流和模型和远程部署！\n\n```\n---\n\n### 公众号直达：[AIGC特异点](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HPH9c0lymUxKDipVcw7PCQ)👈\n### B站直达：[AIGC特异点](https://space.bilibili.com/49766729?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0 )👈\n### 闲鱼店铺直达：[AI服务](https://www.goofish.com/personal?spm=a21ybx.home.nav.1.4c053da6H5SqxH)👈\n### runninghub主页：[AIGC特异点](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=sdhs0trb)👈\n### LIBLIBAI主页：[模型Lora](https://www.liblib.art/userpage/4230c933675a4170a1c9e7b4273325d5/publish )👈\n### Youtube主页：[AIGC-Singularity](https://www.youtube.com/@AIGC-Singularity)👈\n### civitai：[AIGC_Singularity](https://civitai.green/user/AIGC_Singularity)👈\n### 飞群：https://t.me/+iX6ZHABDUes5Y2Qx"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "我的主页", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [326.6436767578125, 425.3616638183594], "pos": [-1597.0540771484375, -1076.3143310546875], "id": 131, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.45.19", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [2290.3876999303084, 1840.7583752548237], "scale": 0.4500000000000177}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "深度控制区", "bounding": [-648.2582397460938, -1118.135009765625, 277.9825134277344, 704.6845092773438]